    <!-- Sheet: Must Know -->
    <string name="sheet_must_know_title">Must Know</string>
    <string name="sheet_must_know_confirm">I Understand</string>
    <string name="sheet_must_know_body">💕 Special Note\n\nThank you for using the 【HyperClipFix】 module. It is free to use; please do not modify or resell it! Please read the following carefully:\n\n1. This module only modifies the clipboard and frequently-used phrases validation logic; it does not affect your data. Please use it with confidence. If your system clipboard works normally, do not install this module!\n2. Starting from v1.3, the module built-in unlocks MIUI keyboard fullscreen optimization limits and adapts to HyperOS 4; some anomalies may appear on OS3. Please test by yourself.\n3. The module has adapted to WeChat Input, Sogou Input, iFlytek Input, QQ Input, Doubao Input, and Gboard.\n4. This module requires LSPosed with the new libxposed API (API 102).\n5. Please enable the recommended scope in the LSPosed framework, then restart your phone, otherwise it won\'t take effect.\n\nFinal reminder: modding has risks; please back up your phone data in time. I am not responsible for any loss!</string>

